Every item is made to order for you, so we can't take back items because of a change of mind or a wrong size choice. Please check the size chart before you order.

## Damaged, misprinted or wrong items

If your item arrives damaged, misprinted, defective or isn't what you ordered, email us at <%= contact %> within 30 days of delivery with your order number and a photo of the problem. We'll send a free replacement or refund you in full, whichever you prefer. You don't need to send the item back.

## Lost packages

If tracking shows no movement for 15 business days, or your package never arrives, contact us and we'll reship your order or refund it.

## Cancellations

You can cancel an order within 12 hours of placing it, before it goes into production. Email us with your order number.

## Refunds

Approved refunds go back to your original payment method within 5–10 business days, depending on your bank.
